### Instructions to Run the Application

1. Run the following commands to set up the application:
   ```bash
   composer install
   php artisan migrate
   ```

2. Start the application:
   ```bash
   php -S 0.0.0.0:5000 -t public
   ```

3. The application will be available at `http://0.0.0.0:5000`.

This implementation ensures secure handling of user inputs using parameterized queries and adheres to the provided requirements.
